# These rules supplement Cursor rules

- Cursor user rules, project rules, team rules, and safety rules stay in force.
- These development rules add to them. They do not replace, cancel, or override a Cursor rule.
- When both apply, follow both.
- When they disagree, follow the Cursor rule, and still apply every part of these rules that does not conflict.
